WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
09:15 — Open wealth. After chai Usman opens wealth on his phone — positions in one portfolio, not four notebooks and a calculator app.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
11:00 — Watchlist. Watchlist on the same phone holds fictional symbols he tracks; LedgerCap tracks, it does not tip or whisper buys.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
15:30 — iPad markets. After close he reads markets on the iPad with tea — calm scan, no pushy “trade now” chrome.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
21:00 — Laptop dividends. Dividend log on the laptop catches what the broker statements bury in PDFs; illustrative figures only.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:40 — Paper trade note. A paper trade on the laptop is practice only — he notes the thesis and closes the lid without placing anything real.

